174	    <section class="section">
175	      <h2 class="section-title">Live token values</h2>
176	      <p class="section-desc">Read at runtime from <code>design-system.css</code> via <code>getComputedStyle</code> — these
177	      reflect the <em>currently active</em> mode and can't drift from the stylesheet. Contrast is text-on-background,
178	      computed in the browser (target 4.5:1 AA).</p>
179	
180	      <table class="token-table">
181	        <thead>
182	          <tr><th>State</th><th>Background</th><th>Border</th><th>Text / icon</th><th>Contrast</th></tr>
183	        </thead>
184	        <tbody id="token-rows"><!-- populated at runtime --></tbody>
185	      </table>
186	
187	      <p class="callout"><strong>Why this can't go stale.</strong> Nothing here hardcodes a hex value — the swatches,
188	      the codes, and the contrast ratios are all derived from the live tokens. Change a token in
189	      <code>design-system.css</code> and this table updates on the next reload. If the stylesheet ever fails to load, the
190	      page visibly breaks, so it doubles as a smoke test.</p>
191	    </section>
192	
193	    <section class="section">
194	      <h2 class="section-title">Usage</h2>
195	      <p class="section-desc">Variants: <code>ds-alert-success</code>, <code>ds-alert-info</code>,
196	      <code>ds-alert-warning</code>, <code>ds-alert-error</code>. Use <code>role="status"</code> for success/info
197	      (polite) and <code>role="alert"</code> for warning/error (assertive); icons carry <code>aria-hidden="true"</code>.</p>
198	
199	      <pre class="code-block">&lt;div class="ds-alert ds-alert-warning" role="alert"&gt;
200	  &lt;svg class="ds-alert-icon" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;!-- icon --&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;
201	  &lt;div class="ds-alert-content"&gt;
202	    &lt;p class="ds-alert-title"&gt;Unsaved changes&lt;/p&gt;
203	    &lt;p&gt;Leaving this page will discard them.&lt;/p&gt;
204	  &lt;/div&gt;
205	&lt;/div&gt;</pre>
206	
207	      <p class="callout"><strong>Deferred.</strong> An action-button slot (Retry / Undo) and a transient toast variant
208	      are not part of this component yet — see <code>DESIGN-PROGRESS.md</code>.</p>
209	    </section>
